Subject: [PATCH 1/6] codex-wasm: compile codex-core for wasm32-wasip1 (browser
 tab)

cfg gates where WASI takes the Unix path or a tab-specific one: path conventions,
system config paths, no-follow fs ops on std::fs, positional I/O via seek, exit
statuses, uds/symlink/sandbox-open stubs; native-tls and wxc_common off on WASI;
[patch] entries for the vendored crates in ../../crates.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
